[{"answer":"Welcome to the Sports Centre.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/1.mp3"},{"answer":"It's good to see that there are so many people wanting to find out about our sports facilities.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/2.mp3"},{"answer":"First of all, membership.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/3.mp3"},{"answer":"All students at the college are entitled to become members of the Sports Centre,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/4.mp3"},{"answer":"for an annual fee of £9.50.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/5.mp3"},{"answer":"To register with us and get your membership card,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/6.mp3"},{"answer":"you need to come to reception, between 2 and 6 pm,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Monday to Thursday.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/8.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm afraid we can't register new members on Friday,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/9.mp3"},{"answer":"so it's Monday to Thursday, 2 to 6, at reception.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/10.mp3"},{"answer":"Now, there are three things that you must remember to bring with you when you come to register;","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/11.mp3"},{"answer":"they are: your Union card,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/12.mp3"},{"answer":"a recent passport-sized photograph of yourself, and the fee.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/13.mp3"},{"answer":"It doesn't matter whether you bring cash or a cheque.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/14.mp3"},{"answer":"We can't issue your card unless you bring all three; so, don't forget:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/15.mp3"},{"answer":"your Union card, passport photo and fee.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/16.mp3"},{"answer":"Then once you have got your sports card,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/17.mp3"},{"answer":"you will need to bring it with you whenever you come to book or use any Sports Centre facilities.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Booking over the phone is not allowed,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/19.mp3"},{"answer":"so you have to come here in person, with your card, when you want to book.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Our opening hours seem to get longer every year.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/21.mp3"},{"answer":"We are now open from 9am to 10pm on weekdays","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/22.mp3"},{"answer":"and from 10am to 6pm on Saturdays.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/23.mp3"},{"answer":"For those of you who are up and about early in the morning,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/24.mp3"},{"answer":"we are introducing a 50% 'morning discount' this year.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/25.mp3"},{"answer":"This is because the facilities tended to be under-used in the mornings last year.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/26.mp3"},{"answer":"It means that all the sessions will be half-price between 9 am and 12 noon on weekdays.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/27.mp3"},{"answer":"So, what exactly are the facilities?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/28.mp3"},{"answer":"What sports can you play here?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, this room we are in at the moment is called the Main Hall,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/30.mp3"},{"answer":"and it's used mainly for team sports such as football, volleyball and basketball,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/31.mp3"},{"answer":"but also for badminton and aerobics.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/32.mp3"},{"answer":"On the other side of the reception area there is the dance studio;","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/33.mp3"},{"answer":"this provides a smaller, more intimate space,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/34.mp3"},{"answer":"which we use for ballet, modern dance and martial arts -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/35.mp3"},{"answer":"not at the same time, of course.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Then, in a separate building, which you may have noticed on your way here...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/37.mp3"},{"answer":"it's on the other side of the car park...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/38.mp3"},{"answer":"there are the squash courts, six of them,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/39.mp3"},{"answer":"and at the far end of the building a fitness room.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/40.mp3"},{"answer":"This is our newest facility, only completed in the Spring,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/41.mp3"},{"answer":"but it is already proving to be one of the most popular.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/42.mp3"},{"answer":"As well as all these facilities available here on the campus,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/43.mp3"},{"answer":"we also have an arrangement with the local tennis club,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/44.mp3"},{"answer":"which is only two miles away,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/45.mp3"},{"answer":"entitling our students to use their courts on weekday mornings in the Summer.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/46.mp3"},{"answer":"So, I think that there should be something here for everybody,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/47.mp3"},{"answer":"and I hope to see all of you at the Centre, making use of the facilities.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/48.mp3"},{"answer":"If, in the course of the year,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/49.mp3"},{"answer":"you have any suggestions as to how the service we provide might be improved","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/50.mp3"},{"answer":"or its appeal widened,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/51.mp3"},{"answer":"I'll be interested to hear from you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-3-part-2-2023-08-16-18-11-23/52.mp3"}]
